# Styling System Rules

## Tailwind CSS
- Use Tailwind utility classes, avoid custom CSS
- Extract repeated class combinations with `cn()` helper
- Use `class-variance-authority` for component variants

## Component Library
- Shared UI components live in `libs/shared/ui/`
- Use `cn()` from `libs/shared/ui/lib/cn.ts` for conditional classes
